+// Same, but keyed in an explicit (non-public) namespace KIND. avmplus.as
+// declares `describeTypeJSON` **internal** to package avmplus, and ASC emits
+// the call site as a QName in PackageInternalNs("avmplus") (kind 0x17) — a
